caldun (1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Portable sensor auto-discovery from "sensors -j" via a driver-class
    allowlist (CPU/GPU/drive); untrustworthy Super-I/O chips ignored.
  * Hybrid thresholds: hardware-reported limits combined conservatively with
    per-category defaults, all overridable in /etc/caldun.conf.
  * "--check" self-test reports discovered sensors and effective thresholds;
    exits 4 when no trustworthy sensor is found.
  * Per-user systemd timer (every 2 minutes) with desktop notifications.

 -- Oliver Glas <oliver.glas@inss.ch>  Sat, 20 Jun 2026 17:59:04 +0200
